{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diamond Town, a fabled place renowned for hosting the grandest dueling card tournaments and home to a community of dedicated duelists. You will compete in the latest edition of Diamond Town's Card King Tournament, battling the town's formidable champions. Your goal: Rise to the top and become the Diamond Town Champion!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Enjoy rich and unrestricted card-building strategies.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Discover deep and fun card interactions. Build unique decks progressively from a diverse card pool.</strong><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875210/extras/e4946e846cfb6c647ff367747c2e4a00.avif?t=1752546793\" data-has-big /></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immerse yourself in thrilling, step-by-step tactical combat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Here, you'll discover the true depth of strategic card battles\u2014where every move demands careful thought and carries decisive weight. Immerse yourself in gameplay where each card played shapes your path to victory.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875210/extras/3db64f25681c30760752d4360e6bff33.avif?t=1752546793\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Discover new depths with every playthrough.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Every run evolves uniquely as you acquire new cards, artifacts, and relics.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets